            <h2>NEP-Certified<br />Non-Combustible Aqua-Crete</h2>
            <div class="ac-keychips">
              <span class="ac-keychip">100% inorganic, non-combustible</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">GORE-TEX® function</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">Strong adhesion</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">Odor- and dust-free</span>
            </div>
