          <div class="ac-concept__body ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <p>Aqua-Crete is an exterior wall finish made from a powder binder
              composed entirely of inorganic, non-combustible ingredients and a
              water-based liquid. It is applied by trowel or spray directly onto
              building substrates — concrete, cement mortar, masonry, tile, EIFS
              finishes, and more — whether the surface is dry or saturated with
              water (100% moisture content).</p>
            <p>Because NEP-certified Aqua-Crete is made from 100%
              non-combustible materials, it does not burn or release toxic gases
              in a fire. It offers excellent breathability and waterproofing
              (GORE-TEX® function), produces no odor or dust during application,
              and bonds powerfully to the substrate — an inorganic,
              non-combustible finish with built-in waterproofing performance.</p>
