            <p>The KS F 8414 full-scale fire test recreates real fire conditions
              to evaluate how an exterior wall finish resists fire spread. The
              Aqua-Crete exterior insulation system is a certified product that
              meets both of the evaluation criteria below.</p>
            <div class="ac-firetest2__crit">
              <div class="ac-firetest2__card">
                <h4>1. External Fire Spread Evaluation</h4>
                <p>Within 15 minutes of the start time, the specimen temperature
                  must not exceed 600 °C for 30 seconds at any external
                  thermocouple at Level 2 (5 m above the top of the test
                  opening).</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ac-firetest2__card">
                <h4>2. Internal Fire Spread Evaluation</h4>
                <p>Within 15 minutes of the start time, the specimen temperature
                  must not exceed 600 °C for 30 seconds at any internal
                  thermocouple at Level 2 (5 m above the top of the test
                  opening).</p>
              </div>
            </div>
